#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut13_view3d
#! fresh   /tmp/figure-studio
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio --case /tmp/figure-studio/plate
#! frames  560
#! poster  425
# F5 runs the solver; View > Run hides the Run panel; the 3-D button shows the field as a surface with the body; Fit
# and the wheel fill the panel; the grid; the pointer reads the temperature; the cut along the probe line; a click
# moves the Result panel's probe point there, and the Result tab shows it (the frames start once the run has ended)
0   move 600 300
5   key f5
6   wait
200 move 157 11 10
212 down
214 up
225 move 185 75 10
237 down
239 up
250 move 37 300 10
262 down
264 up
275 move 446 61 10
